# Copy to .env (which is GITIGNORED — the path is machine-specific) and point it at your own disc
# image of Vagrant Story (USA), SLUS-01040. The image is never shipped with this repo.
#
# Resolution order (tools/resolve_disc.py is the ONE implementation): a CLI argument >
# $PSXPORT_VAGRANT_DISC > this file > a *.chd dropped in the repo root.
PSXPORT_VAGRANT_DISC=/path/to/Vagrant Story (USA).chd
